meta {
  name: Generate Visual Design
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/visual-designs/generate
  body: multipartForm
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:multipart-form {
  image: @file()
  mask: @file()
  placementType: indoor
}

script:post-response {
  const createdId = res.body?.id ?? res.body?.[0]?.id;
  if (res.status === 200 && createdId) {
    bru.setVar("designId", createdId);
  }
}

docs {
  # Generate Visual Design
  Accepts an original room/building photo and a binary inpainting mask, builds a placement-specific architectural prompt (`indoor` split unit or `outdoor` compressor unit), creates a pending record, and runs the AI image generation pipeline via `visualDesignService.processAndSaveDesign`.

  ### Authentication
  - **Bearer Token** required (`Authorization: Bearer <token>`).

  ### Request Body (`multipart/form-data`)
  - `image` (file, required): Original background photo (maximum **10 MB**, max 1 file).
  - `mask` (file, required): Inpainting mask image defining the AC placement area (maximum **10 MB**, max 1 file).
  - `placementType` (string, required): Placement target — must be either `"indoor"` or `"outdoor"`.

  ### Responses
  - `200 OK`: Returns the completed visual design record object.
  - `400 Bad Request`: Missing `image` or `mask` file (`{ "message": "The original image and mask are required!" }`), invalid `placementType` (`{ "message": "Invalid placement type. (indoor/outdoor)" }`), or Multer upload limit exceeded.
  - `401 Unauthorized`: Missing or invalid JWT token.
  - `500 Internal Server Error`: Error occurred during AI generation or storage (`{ "message": "Error occurred while generating the visual design." }`).
}